OL,4,CUK sanctions top Myanmar military      
OL,5,Cleaders after Rohingya genocide ruling 
OL,6,GThe UK has sanctioned five senior      
OL,7,GMyanmar military leaders after the     
OL,8,GInternational Court of Justice (ICJ)   
OL,9,Gruled that the country had carried out 
OL,10,Ggenocide against the Rohingya minority 
OL,11,G` marking the first time a state has   
OL,12,Gbeen found guilty of the crime.        
OL,14,FA military crackdown in 2017 killed    
OL,15,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more  
OL,16,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority 
OL,17,FMyanmar, formerly known as Burma.      
OL,19,FThe UK is joined by several other      
OL,20,Fcountries in acknowledging the ICJ     
OL,21,Fruling, including Australia, Belgium,  
OL,22,FPortugal, Spain and Canada.            
